gned}\n$$\n\nThis equation does not have any solutions since its left-hand side is always nonnegative, while the right-hand side is negative.\n\nTherefore, $f(x)$ has no root." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-102548/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4d059c56-ae7f-5fb6-8bc6-2ce97bb7f876"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-102548"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-270607/field-1/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "743a8da6-f55f-5b34-b76c-20af9a5ef9da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-270607/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7132cf43-4e78-52fc-af72-55cffcacd94c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-270607/field-1/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer-field/choices ["q-270607/field-1/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-270607" :question/id #uuid "42d549bc-4fc3-5369-9de9-101c218700ad" :question/math-academy-id "q-270607" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find the root of  $f(x)=\\sqrt[6]{24x+13}-1.$\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To find the roots of $f(x),$ we must solve $f(x)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[6]{24x+13}-1=0\n$$\n\nWe solve this equation by making $x$ the subject, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[6]{24x+13}-1 & =0 \\\\ \\sqrt[6]{24x+13} & =1 \\\\ {(\\sqrt[6]{24x+13})}^{6} & ={1}^{6} \\\\ 24x+13 & =1 \\\\ 24x & =-12 \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we must check the answer by substituting it back into the initial equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[6]{24\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})+13}-1 & =0 \\\\ \\sqrt[6]{1}-1 & =0 \\\\ 0 & =0\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the root of $f(x)$ is $x=-\\frac{1}{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-270607/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4d059c56-ae7f-5fb6-8bc6-2ce97bb7f876"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-270607"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-277229/field-1/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab" :answer/id #uuid "6b7cebab-4370-58ab-a46b-14e5670e2c22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-277229/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "316a0280-3f04-5ebb-9b33-35b0ffc43d8b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-277229/field-1/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab" :answer-field/choices ["q-277229/field-1/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-277229" :question/id #uuid "d26ae3f0-7bd0-505c-ac51-a94ff7ad74e3" :question/math-academy-id "q-277229" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find the root of $f(x)=\\sqrt[3]{2x+10}-4.$\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To find the root of $f(x),$ we must solve $f(x)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{2x+10}-4=0\n$$\n\nWe solve this equation by making $x$ the subject, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{2x+10}-4 & =0 \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{2x+10} & =4 \\\\ (\\sqrt[3]{2x+10})^{3} & ={4}^{3} \\\\ 2x+10 & =64 \\\\ 2x & =54 \\\\ x & =27\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the root of $f(x)$ is $x=27.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-277229/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e6159dd-c12e-5882-be17-815b4cc9ae52"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-277229"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
